  "label": "Cynical Parental Divorce Meme",
  "description": "This meme is part of a broader internet culture that sometimes trivializes or humorously exaggerates the consequences of parental divorce, often by focusing on perceived material benefits for children. It reflects a cynical view that reduces a complex, emotionally charged life event to a superficial joke, which can be seen as insensitive or dismissive of the real emotional impact on children and families.",
